<title>SRI LANKA: Smallholder 12-mth net up 65 pct.</title>
<headline>Smallholder 12-mth net up 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd, for the 12 months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			   1997	    1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	  701.54   vs   529.31</p>
<p>    Net profit	 82.80   vs    50.25</p>
<p>    Tax		  17.27   vs    23.83</p>
<p>NOTE - Tea Smallholder Factories processes tea leaf bought from small cultivators.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
